	"description": {
		"ja": [
			"『デジモンアドベンチャー』より、オメガモンがFigure-rise Standard Amplifiedで登場！",
			"• 原作リスペクトの元、キャラクターの魅力を“増幅”させたAMPLIFIEDシリーズ第1弾！",
			"• 各パーツの配色を成形色で再現。白いパーツにはグロスインジェクションを採用。",
			"• オメガモンの魅力を更に際立たせるために、各パーツをシャープ化。",
			"• 腰部の拡張用３mm穴がプラモデルとしての可能性をさらに増幅(AMPLIFIED)。"
		],
		"en": [
			"From \"Digimon Adventure\", Omegamon appears in Figure-rise Standard Amplified!",
			"• The first in the AMPLIFIED series, which respects the original work and amplifies the charm of the characters!",
			"• The color scheme of each part is reproduced with molded colors. Gloss injection is used for white parts.",
			"• Each part has been sharpened to further highlight Omegamon's charm.",
			"• The 3mm expansion hole in the waist further amplifies its potential as a plastic model (AMPLIFIED)."
		]
	},
